%N A021136 Decimal expansion of 1/132.
%C A021136 Multiplied by -1, this is zeta(-9), where zeta is the Riemann zeta function. - _Alonso del Arte_, Jan 13 2012
%C A021136 5/66 = 10 * (1/312) is the 10th Bernoulli number (A027641(10)/A027642(10)). - _Amiram Eldar_, Jul 25 2026
%D A021136 François Le Lionnais, Les Nombres Remarquables, Paris, Hermann, 1983, p. 22.
%H A021136 <a href="/index/Rec#order_02">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,1).
%F A021136 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Oct 13 2025: (Start)
%F A021136 G.f.: x^2*(7 + 5*x)/((1 - x)*(1 + x)).
%F A021136 E.g.f.: 7*(cosh(x) - 1) + 5*(sinh(x) - x). (End)
%e A021136 0.00757575757575757575757575757575757575757575757575...
